             # User and dev guides\n│   │   ├── DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md\n│   │   ├── DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md\n│   │   ├── TROUBLESHOOTING.md\n│   │   └── API_GUIDE.md\n│   └── api/                          # API documentation\n│       ├── API_DOCUMENTATION.md\n│       ├── REST_API.md\n│       ├── GRAPHQL_SCHEMA.md\n│       └── WEBSOCKET_API.md\n\n├── testing/                          # Test suite\n│   ├── unit/                         # Unit tests\n│   │   ├── test_memory_manager.py\n│   │   ├── test_cognitive_engine.py\n│   │   ├── test_communication.py\n│   │   ├── test_integration.py\n│   │   └── test_database_managers/\n│   ├── integration/                  # Integration tests\n│   │   ├── test_memory_integration.py\n│   │   ├── test_cognitive_integration.py\n│   │   └── test_communication_integration.py\n│   └── performance/                  # Performance tests\n│       ├── test_memory_performance.py\n│       ├── test_cognitive_performance.py\n│       └── test_communication_performance.py\n\n├── config/                           # Configuration files\n│   ├── development/                  # Development environment\n│   │   ├── database.conf\n│   │   ├── signalcore.conf\n│   │   └── logging.conf\n│   ├── staging/                      # Staging environment\n│   │   ├── database.conf\n│   │   ├── signalcore.conf\n│   │   └── logging.conf\n│   └── production/                   # Production environment\n│       ├── database.conf\n│       ├── signalcore.conf\n│       ├── logging.conf\n│       └── security.conf\n\n├── scripts/                          # Utility scripts\n│   ├── deployment/                   # Deployment automation\n│   │   ├── deploy.sh\n│   │   ├── rollback.sh\n│   │   ├── scale.sh\n│   │   └── health_check.sh\n│   ├── maintenance/                  # Maintenance utilities\n│   │   ├── cleanup_memory.sh\n│   │   ├── backup_databases.sh\n│   │   ├── optimize_performance.sh\n│   │   └── rotate_logs.sh\n│   └── utilities/                    # General utilities\n│       ├── setup_development.sh\n│       ├── reset_databases.sh\n│       ├── load_test_data.sh\n│       └── generate_docs.sh\n\n├── examples/                         # Code examples\n│   ├── memory_examples.py\n│   ├── communication_examples.py\n│   ├── cognitive_examples.py\n│   └── integration_examples.py\n\n├── tools/                            # Development tools\n│   ├── code_formatter.py\n│   ├── type_checker.py\n│   ├── security_scanner.py\n│   └── performance_profiler.py\n\n└── benchmarks/                       # Performance benchmarks\n    ├── memory_benchmarks.py\n    ├── cognitive_benchmarks.py\n    └── communication_benchmarks.py\n```\n\n## Key Directories Explained\n\n### `/core/` - System Core\n**Purpose**: Contains the main business logic and system components\n- `memory/`: Multi-tier persistent memory management\n- `communication/`: Agent messaging and human interfaces\n- `cognitive/`: AI reasoning, learning, and decision-making\n- `integration/`: System orchestration and API gateway\n\n### `/infrastructure/` - Infrastructure Management\n**Purpose**: Handles all infrastructure-related code and configurations\n- `databases/`: Database connection and management logic\n- `deployment/`: Kubernetes, Docker, and Terraform configs\n- `monitoring/`: Prometheus, Grafana, and alerting configurations\n\n### `/docs/` - Documentation\n**Purpose**: Comprehensive documentation for developers and users\n- `architecture/`: System design and technical specifications\n- `best-practices/`: Development standards and guidelines\n- `guides/`: User guides and troubleshooting documentation\n- `api/`: API documentation and schemas\n\n### `/testing/` - Quality Assurance\n**Purpose**: Comprehensive test suite ensuring system reliability\n- `unit/`: Individual component testing\n- `integration/`: End-to-end system testing\n- `performance/`: Load testing and performance validation\n\n### `/config/` - Configuration Management\n**Purpose**: Environment-specific configurations\n- `development/`: Local development settings\n- `staging/`: Pre-production testing environment\n- `production/`: Live production environment\n\n### `/scripts/` - Automation\n**Purpose**: Utility scripts for operations and maintenance\n- `deployment/`: Automated deployment and rollback scripts\n- `maintenance/`: System maintenance and optimization tools\n- `utilities/`: General purpose development utilities\n\n## File Naming Conventions\n\n### Python Files\n- **Snake case**: `intelligent_memory_manager.py`\n- **Descriptive names**: `test_memory_performance.py`\n- **Module indicators**: `_manager.py`, `_engine.py`, `_router.py`\n\n### Configuration Files\n- **Environment indicators**: `database.dev.conf`, `database.prod.conf`\n- **Service indicators**: `signalcore.conf`, `nginx.conf`\n\n### Documentation Files\n- **Descriptive names**: `SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md`\n- **Type indicators**: `API_DOCUMENTATION.md`, `DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md`\n\n### Test Files\n- **Test prefix**: `test_memory_manager.py`\n- **Test type indicators**: `test_memory_integration.py`, `test_performance.py`\n\n## Development Workflow\n\n### Adding New Features\n1. **Create feature branch** from `develop`\n2. **Add code** in appropriate `/core/` subdirectory\n3. **Write tests** in `/testing/` directory\n4. **Update documentation** in `/docs/` directory\n5. **Update configuration** if needed in `/config/`\n6. **Create example code** in `/examples/` directory\n\n### Infrastructure Changes\n1. **Update configs** in `/infrastructure/` subdirectory\n2. **Add tests** to `/testing/` if applicable\n3. **Update deployment guides** in `/docs/guides/`\n4. **Test changes** using `/scripts/deployment/`\n\n### Documentation Updates\n1. **Update relevant guide** in `/docs/guides/`\n2. **Update API docs** in `/docs/api/` if needed\n3. **Regenerate docs** using `/scripts/utilities/generate_docs.sh`\n4. **Update examples** in `/examples/` if behavior changed\n\n---\n\n*This structure ensures maintainability, scalability, and ease of development for the SignalCore project.*",
