              "content": "# SignalCore - AI Intelligence Operating System\n\n## Overview\nSignalCore is the brain infrastructure for adaptive AI agents, providing persistent memory, intelligent communication, and cognitive reasoning capabilities.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n### Core Systems (`/core/`)\n- **`memory/`** - Multi-tier memory management (DragonflyDB, Redis, MongoDB, ClickHouse, Qdrant, PostgreSQL)\n- **`communication/`** - Agent-to-agent messaging and HITL interfaces (NATS, RedPanda)\n- **`cognitive/`** - AI reasoning, learning, and decision-making engines\n- **`integration/`** - System orchestration and coordination\n\n### Infrastructure (`/infrastructure/`)\n- **`databases/`** - Database configurations and connection management\n- **`deployment/`** - Deployment scripts and containerization\n- **`monitoring/`** - Health checks, metrics, and observability\n\n### Documentation (`/docs/`)\n- **`architecture/`** - System design and technical specifications\n- **`best-practices/`** - Development guidelines and standards\n- **`guides/`** - User and developer documentation\n- **`api/`** - API documentation and schemas\n\n### Testing (`/testing/`)\n- **`unit/`** - Unit tests for core components\n- **`integration/`** - End-to-end system tests\n- **`performance/`** - Load and performance testing\n\n### Configuration (`/config/`)\n- **`development/`** - Development environment settings\n- **`staging/`** - Staging environment configuration\n- **`production/`** - Production deployment settings\n\n### Scripts (`/scripts/`)\n- **`deployment/`** - Deployment automation\n- **`maintenance/`** - System maintenance utilities\n- **`utilities/`** - General purpose scripts\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Prerequisites\n- Python 3.8+\n- Redis/DragonflyDB\n- MongoDB 7.0+\n- PostgreSQL 14+\n- ClickHouse\n- Qdrant\n- NATS\n\n### Installation\n```bash\n# Clone repository\ngit clone <repository-url>\ncd signalcore\n\n# Install dependencies\npip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Setup database connections\ncp config/development/database.conf.example config/development/database.conf\n\n# Run tests\npython -m pytest testing/\n\n# Start development server\npython core/integration/signalcore_server.py\n```\n\n## Development Guidelines\n\n### Code Standards\n- Follow PEP 8 for Python code\n- Use type hints for all function signatures\n- Document all public APIs\n- Write comprehensive tests for new features\n\n### Database Access\n- Always use connection pooling\n- Implement proper error handling\n- Use parameterized queries\n- Follow database-specific best practices\n\n### Memory Management\n- Use appropriate TTL for different memory tiers\n- Implement automatic cleanup procedures\n- Monitor memory usage and performance\n- Document memory usage patterns\n\n### Communication Protocols\n- Standardize message formats\n- Implement proper error handling\n- Use async/await for I/O operations\n- Monitor message throughput and latency\n\n## Contributing\n\n1. Create feature branch from `main`\n2. Make changes with tests\n3. Update documentation\n4. Submit pull request\n5. Code review required\n6. Merge after approval\n\n## Security\n\n- All database connections use authentication\n- Implement proper access controls\n- Regular security audits\n- Follow OWASP guidelines\n\n## Monitoring\n\n- Health check endpoints\n- Performance metrics\n- Error tracking\n- System alerts\n\n## Support\n\n- Documentation: `/docs/`\n- Issues: GitHub Issues\n- Discussions: GitHub Discussions\n- Email: support@adapt.ai\n\n---\n\n*SignalCore - Building the future of AI intelligence*",
