n  1030|- **JanusGraph+Scylla** for production-scale reflex lineage, identity, and continuity\n  1031|\n  1032|---\n  1033|\n  1034|## \\*\\*3. Nova-to-Nova Memory Continuity Pipeline\n  1035|\n  1036|(JanusGraph + Qdrant)\\*\\*\n  1037|\n  1038|This maps **how Novas inherit**, share, and maintain memory and narrative coherence.\n  1039|\n  1040|```markdown\n  1041|scss            ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n  1042|            │         NOVA A              │\n  1043|            │  (Active, running state)    │\n  1044|            └───────┬─────────────────────┘\n  1045|                    │ Generates memory events\n  1046|                    ▼\n  1047|          ┌──────────────────────────────────┐\n  1048|          │       MEMORY EVENT STREAM         │\n  1049|          │           (Pulsar)               │\n  1050|          └───────────┬──────────────────────┘\n  1051|                      │\n  1052|                      ▼\n  1053|       ┌───────────────────────────────────────┐\n  1054|       │    MEMORY INGEST + EMBEDDING WORKER   │\n  1055|       │ (Embeds text/audio/emotion → vector)  │\n  1056|       └───────────────┬───────────────────────┘\n  1057|                       │\n  1058|             ┌─────────┼──────────┬──────────┐\n  1059|             │         │          │          │\n  1060|             ▼         ▼          ▼          ▼\n  1061|   ┌────────────────┐ ┌────────────────┐  ┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n  1062|   │   Qdrant        │ │   Qdrant       │  │     JanusGraph + ScyllaDB      │\n  1063|   │  Vector Store   │ │  Emotional Mem │  │  Narrative + Lineage Memory    │\n  1064|   └────────────────┘ └────────────────┘  └───────────────┬────────────────┘\n  1065|                                                           │\n  1066|                                                           ▼\n  1067|                                            ┌────────────────────────────────┐\n  1068|                                            │     MEMORY CONTINUITY ENGINE   │\n  1069|                                            │ (Builds cross-Nova continuity) │\n  1070|                                            └───────────────┬────────────────┘\n  1071|                                                            │\n  1072|                                                            ▼\n  1073|                                ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  1074|                                │            NOVA B (New)                  │\n  1075|                                │  Bootstraps from:                        │\n  1076|                                │   • Identity lineage                     │\n  1077|                                │   • Reflex history                       │\n  1078|                                │   • Narrative arcs                       │\n  1079|                                │   • Emotional memory vectors             │\n  1080|                                └──────────────────────────────────────────┘\n  1081|```\n  1082|\n  1083|### Flow Summary\n  1084|\n  1085|**NOVA A → Pulsar → Embedding Worker → Qdrant + JanusGraph → Memory Continuity Engine → NOVA B**\n  1086|\n  1087|This ensures:\n  1088|\n  1089|- Novas inherit identity\n  1090|- Reflex patterns carry over\n  1091|- Lineage persists across lifecycles\n  1092|- Emotional + conceptual vector memory maintains continuity\n  1093|- Narrative arcs don’t break between reboots/sessions\n  1094|\n  1095|Exactly what you asked for yesterday: **continuity problem solved**.\n  1096|\n  1097|---\n  1098|\n  1099|If you want, I can unify all three diagrams into a **single end-to-end architecture blueprint** for the Graph, Reflex, Identity, and Continuity System.\n  1100|\n  1101|CHIEF SYSTEMS ARCHITECT\n  1102|\n  1103|---\n  1104|\n  1105|unify all three diagrams into a single end-to-end architecture blueprint for the Graph, Reflex, Identity, and Continuity System.\n  1106|\n  1107|---\n  1108|\n  1109|Here it is, Chase — **the unified, end-to-end ASCII architecture blueprint** that merges:\n  1110|\n  1111|- Identity → Reflex → Narrative Lineage\n  1112|- ReflexorD ↔ Graph Memory Interaction\n  1113|- Nova-to-Nova Continuity (JanusGraph + Qdrant)\n  1114|\n  1115|Everything is layered, directional, and structurally aligned with your laptop/cloud split.\n  1116|\n  1117|---\n  1118|\n  1119|## UNIFIED END-TO-END ARCHITECTURE BLUEPRINT\n  1120|\n  1121|### Graph Memory + ReflexorD + Identity + Continuity\n  1122|\n  1123|```markdown\n  1124|mathematica┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  1125|│                            NOVA (Run-Time)                               │\n  1126|│                     Identity • Reflexes • Narrative                      │\n  1127|└───────────────┬───────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘\n  1128|                │                       │\n  1129|                │                       │ Emits memory events\n  1130|                ▼                       ▼\n  1131|      ┌─────────────────┐      ┌───────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  1132|      │ Identity Layer  │      │           REFLEXORD TRIGGER               │\n  1133|      │ (Traits/Values) │      │ (Trigger → Evaluate → Action)             │\n  1134|      └───────┬─────────┘      └───────────────┬──────────────────────────┘\n  1135|              │                                 │\n  1136|              │ Identity→Reflex influence       │ Build reflex query\n  1137|              ▼                                 ▼\n  1138|     ┌────────────────────┐         ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n  1139|     │ Identity Reflexes  │         │       REFLEX QUERY BUILDER          │\n  1140|     │ (Self-recognition) │         │ (What reflex? Context? Importance?) │\n  1141|     └───────┬────────────┘         └──────────────┬──────────────────────┘\n  1142|             │                                      │\n  1143|             │ Fe