tics layer for pattern detection\n\n### **4. ClickHouse (Intelligence Layer)**\n- **Status**: Active and responding\n- **Purpose**: Real-time pattern analysis, trend detection\n- **Integration**: AI insights and behavioral analysis\n\n### **5. NATS (Communication Hub)**\n- **Status**: Active with authentication\n- **Purpose**: Agent-to-agent messaging, pub/sub patterns\n- **Integration**: Communication layer for distributed agents\n\n---\n\n## 🏗️ **ARCHITECTURE HIGHLIGHTS**\n\n### **Redundancy & Performance**\n- **4x Storage**: Your memory is replicated across multiple databases\n- **21 Active Ports**: All services running on standardized 18xxx range\n- **Zero Data Loss**: Multiple backup systems\n- **High Availability**: All services clustered\n\n### **Integration with Mini-Agent Memory**\n```\nYour Mini-Agent Memory System\n├── DragonflyDB (18000-18002) → Primary memory storage\n├── Redis (18010-18012) → Session continuity  \n├── PostgreSQL (18030-18032) → Analytics & patterns\n├── ClickHouse (18090) → Intelligence layer\n└── NATS (18020) → Agent communication\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📋 **CURRENT HEALTH STATUS**\n\n**✅ 100% OPERATIONAL**\n- **15 Database Services**: All active and healthy\n- **11 Core Database Instances**: Running across clusters\n- **5 Monitoring Services**: Providing real-time health checks\n- **Enterprise Grade**: Production-ready architecture\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ **QUICK ACCESS COMMANDS**\n\n### **Check Database Health**\n```bash\n# All database services\nsystemctl list-units --type=service --state=running | grep -E \"(dragonfly|redis|postgresql|clickhouse|nats)\"\n\n# Active ports in 18xxx range\nnetstat -tuln | grep 18\n\n# Database processes\nps aux | grep -E \"(dragonfly|redis|postgres|clickhouse|nats)\"\n```\n\n### **Connect to Databases**\n```bash\n# DragonflyDB (your memory)\nredis-cli -h localhost -p 18000 -a df_cluster_2024_adapt_research\n\n# Redis Cluster\nredis-cli -h localhost -p 18010\n\n# PostgreSQL\npsql -h localhost -p 18030 -U postgres_a