              "content": "# SignalCore API Documentation\n\n## Overview\n\nSignalCore provides REST and GraphQL APIs for memory management, agent communication, and cognitive operations.\n\n## Base URLs\n\n- **Development**: `http://localhost:8000/api/v1`\n- **Staging**: `https://staging-api.adapt.ai/api/v1`\n- **Production**: `https://api.adapt.ai/api/v1`\n\n## Authentication\n\nAll API requests require authentication via JWT tokens:\n\n```http\nAuthorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>\n```\n\n## Core Endpoints\n\n### Memory Management\n\n#### Store Memory\n```http\nPOST /memory/store\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  \"key\": \"unique_memory_key\",\n  \"content\": {\n    \"data\": \"memory content\",\n    \"metadata\": {}\n  },\n  \"memory_type\": \"conversation|knowledge|preference|pattern\",\n  \"importance\": 7,\n  \"context\": \"work|personal|general\",\n  \"tags\": [\"tag1\", \"tag2\"],\n  \"ttl_hours\": 24\n}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"memory_id\": \"mem_123456789\",\n  \"stored_in\": [\"dragonfly\", \"mongodb\"],\n  \"tier\": \"short_term\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Retrieve Memory\n```http\nGET /memory/retrieve/{key}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"memory\": {\n    \"key\": \"unique_memory_key\",\n    \"content\": {\n      \"data\": \"memory content\",\n      \"metadata\": {}\n    },\n    \"memory_type\": \"conversation\",\n    \"importance\": 7,\n    \"created_at\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n    \"tier\": \"short_term\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Search Memory\n```http\nGET /memory/search?query=search_term&memory_types=conversation,knowledge&tiers=short_term,medium_term&limit=10\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"key\": \"result_key\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"data\": \"relevant content\",\n        \"relevance_score\": 0.95\n      },\n      \"memory_type\": \"conversation\",\n      \"tier\": \"short_term\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total_found\": 1,\n  \"search_time_ms\": 15\n}\n```\n\n#### Delete Memory\n```http\nDELETE /memory/delete/{key}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"deleted_from\": [\"dragonfly\", \"mongodb\"],\n  \"deleted_at\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n### Agent Communication\n\n#### Send Message\n```http\nPOST /communication/send\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  \"recipient\": \"agent_456\",\n  \"message_type\": \"request|response|notification|command\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"data\": \"message content\",\n    \"metadata\": {}\n  },\n  \"priority\": \"normal|high|urgent\",\n  \"timeout_seconds\": 30\n}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message_id\": \"msg_123456789\",\n  \"sent_at\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"delivery_status\": \"pending|delivered|failed\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Receive Message\n```http\nGET /communication/receive?timeout=5\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"msg_123456789\",\n      \"sender\": \"agent_456\",\n      \"message_type\": \"response\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"data\": \"response content\"\n      },\n      \"priority\": \"normal\",\n      \"received_at\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"count\": 1\n}\n```\n\n#### Broadcast Message\n```http\nPOST /communication/broadcast\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  \"message_type\": \"notification\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"data\": \"broadcast content\"\n  },\n  \"recipients\": [\"agent_456\", \"agent_789\"],\n  \"priority\": \"normal\"\n}\n```\n\n### Cognitive Operations\n\n#### Process Query\n```http\nPOST /cognitive/query\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  \"query\": \"What is the best approach for this problem?\",\n  \"context\": {\n    \"domain\": \"technical\",\n    \"urgency\": \"normal\"\n  },\n  \"include_memory\": true,\n  \"max_response_length\": 500\n}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"response\": \"Based on the context and previous interactions...\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.87,\n  \"reasoning_steps\": [\n    \"Analyzed query context\",\n    \"Retrieved relevant memory\",\n    \"Applied reasoning framework\",\n    \"Generated response\"\n  ],\n  \"memory_updated\": true,\n  \"processing_time_ms\": 125\n}\n```\n\n#### Learn from Interaction\n```http\nPOST /cognitive/learn\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  \"interaction_type\": \"user_query|agent_response|feedback\",\n  \"content\": {\n    \"query\": \"user question\",\n    \"response\": \"agent answer\",\n    \"feedback\": \"positive|negative\"\n  },\n  \"extract_patterns\": true,\n  \"update_models\": true\n}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"patterns_extracted\": 2,\n  \"knowledge_updated\": true,\n  \"learning_confidence\": 0.92,\n  \"next_recommendations\": [\n    \"Consider alternative approaches\",\n    \"Monitor success metrics\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### System Operations\n\n#### Health Check\n```http\nGET /system/health\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"healthy|degraded|unhealthy\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"checks\": {\n    \"memory\": {\n      \"status\": \"healthy\",\n      \"databases_connected\": 6,\n      \"total_memories\": 15420\n    },\n    \"communication\": {\n      \"status\": \"healthy\",\n      \"messages_per_second\": 245,\n      \"latency_ms\": 5.2\n    },\n    \"cognitive\": {\n      \"status\": \"healthy\",\n      \"queries_processed\": 1234,\n      \"average_response_time_ms\": 98\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Get Statistics\n```http\nGET /system/stats\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"statistics\": {\n    \"uptime_seconds\": 86400,\n    \"total_queries\": 5678,\n    \"memory_usage\": {\n      \"short_term\": 1234,\n      \"medium_term\": 5678,\n      \"long_term\": 9012\n    },\n    \"performance\": {\n      \"average_response_time_ms\": 87,\n      \"queries_per_second\": 156,\n      \"success_rate\": 0.995\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Error Responses\n\nAll endpoints return consistent error responses:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"MEMORY_NOT_FOUND\",\n    \"message\": \"The requested memory key was not found\",\n    \"details\": {\n      \"key\": \"missing_key\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Common Error Codes\n\n| Code | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `INVALID_REQUEST` | Malformed request data |\n| `UNAUTHORIZED` | Invalid or missing authentication |\n| `MEMORY_NOT_FOUND` | Requested memory key does not exist |\n| `DATABASE_ERROR` | Database connection or query error |\n| `RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED` | Too many requests |\n| `SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE` | Service temporarily unavailable |\n\n## GraphQL Schema\n\n```graphql\ntype Memory {\n  key: String!\n  content: JSON!\n  memoryType: String!\n  importance: Int!\n  tier: String!\n  createdAt: String!\n  tags: [String!]!\n}\n\ntype Message {\n  messageId: String!\n  sender: String!\n  recipient: String!\n  messageType: String!\n  payload: JSON!\n  priority: String!\n  sentAt: String!\n}\n\ntype Query {\n  # Memory operations\n  retrieveMemory(key: String!): Memory!\n  searchMemories(\n    query: String!\n    memoryTypes: [String!]\n    tiers: [String!]\n    limit: Int = 10\n  ): [Memory!]!\n  \n  # Communication\n  receiveMessages(timeout: Int = 5): [Message!]!\n  \n  # Cognitive\n  processQuery(\n    query: String!\n    context: JSON\n    includeMemory: Boolean = true\n  ): CognitiveResponse!\n  \n  # System\n  systemStats: SystemStats!\n  healthCheck: HealthStatus!\n}\n\ntype Mutation {\n  # Memory\n  storeMemory(input: StoreMemoryInput!): StoreMemoryResponse!\n  deleteMemory(key: String!): DeleteMemoryResponse!\n  \n  # Communication\n  sendMessage(input: SendMessageInput!): SendMessageResponse!\n  broadcastMessage(input: BroadcastMessageInput!): BroadcastMessageResponse!\n  \n  # Cognitive\n  learnFromInteraction(input: LearnInput!): LearnResponse!\n}\n\ntype Subscription {\n  # Real-time message delivery\n  messageReceived(agentId: String!): Message!\n  \n  # System updates\n  systemStatusUpdates: HealthStatus!\n}\n\ninput StoreMemoryInput {\n  key: String!\n  content: JSON!\n  memoryType: String!\n  importance: Int!\n  context: String\n  tags: [String!]\n  ttlHours: Int\n}\n\ntype StoreMemoryResponse {\n  success: Boolean!\n  memoryId: String\n  storedIn: [String!]\n  tier: String\n}\n\n# ... other input/output types\n```\n\n## WebSocket API\n\n### Connection\n```javascript\nconst ws = new WebSocket('wss://api.adapt.ai/ws/v1');\nws.send(JSON.stringify({\n  type: 'auth',\n  token: 'your-jwt-token'\n}));\n```\n\n### Message Format\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"message_received|system_status|error\",\n  \"data\": {\n    // Message content\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n## Rate Limits\n\n| Endpoint Category | Rate Limit |\n|------------------|------------|\n| Memory Operations | 1000/hour |\n| Communication | 5000/hour |\n| Cognitive Queries | 500/hour |\n| System Operations | 100/hour |\n\n## SDK Examples\n\n### Python SDK\n```python\nfrom signalcore import SignalCoreClient\n\nclient = SignalCoreClient(\n    base_url=\"https://api.adapt.ai/api/v1\",\n    auth_token=\"your-jwt-token\"\n)\n\n# Store memory\nresult = client.memory.store(\n    key=\"user_preference\",\n    content={\"theme\": \"dark\"},\n    memory_type=\"preference\",\n    importance=7\n)\n\n# Send message\nresponse = client.communication.send(\n    recipient=\"agent_456\",\n    message_type=\"request\",\n    payload={\"query\": \"status check\"}\n)\n```\n\n### JavaScript SDK\n```javascript\nimport { SignalCoreClient } from '@adapt/signalcore';\n\nconst client = new SignalCoreClient({\n  baseUrl: 'https://api.adapt.ai/api/v1',\n  authToken: 'your-jwt-token'\n});\n\n// Store memory\nconst result = await client.memory.store({\n  key: 'user_preference',\n  content: { theme: 'dark' },\n  memoryType: 'preference',\n  importance: 7\n});\n\n// Process query\nconst response = await client.cognitive.processQuery({\n  query: 'What should I do next?',\n  context: { urgency: 'high' }\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n*For more detailed API documentation, visit our interactive API explorer at https://api.adapt.ai/docs*",
