tors\n  1030|- **JanusGraph+Scylla** for production-scale reflex lineage, identity, and continuity\n  1031|\n  1032|---\n  1033|\n  1034|## \\*\\*3. Nova-to-Nova Memory Continuity Pipeline\n  1035|\n  1036|(JanusGraph + Qdrant)\\*\\*\n  1037|\n  1038|This maps **how Novas inherit**, share, and maintain memory and narrative coherence.\n  1039|\n  1040|```markdown\n  1041|scss            ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n  1042|            │         NOVA A              │\n  1043|            │  (Active, running state)    │\n  1044|            └───────┬─────────────────────┘\n  1045|                    │ Generates memory events\n  1046|                    ▼\n  1047|          ┌──────────────────────────────────┐\n  1048|          │       MEMORY EVENT STREAM         │\n  1049|          │           (Pulsar)               │\n  1050|          └───────────┬──────────────────────┘\n  1051|                      │\n  1052|                      ▼\n  1053|       ┌───────────────────────────────────────┐\n  1054|       │    MEMORY INGEST + EMBEDDING WORKER   │\n  1055|       │ (Embeds text/audio/emotion → vector)  │\n  1056|       └───────────────┬───────────────────────┘\n  1057|                       │\n  1058|             ┌─────────┼──────────┬──────────┐\n  1059|             │         │          │          │\n  1060|             ▼         ▼          ▼          ▼\n  1061|   ┌────────────────┐ ┌────────────────┐  ┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n  1062|   │   Qdrant        │ │   Qdrant       │  │     JanusGraph + ScyllaDB      │\n  1063|   │  Vector Store   │ │  Emotional Mem │  │  Narrative + Lineage Memory    │\n  1064|   └────────────────┘ └────────────────┘  └───────────────┬────────────────┘\n  1065|                                                           │\n  1066|                                                           ▼\n  1067|                                            ┌────────────────────────────────┐\n  1068|                                            │     ME