Nova Task Engine)\n   315|\n   316|Tasks must be:\n   317|\n   318|- reflex-triggerable\n   319|- lineage-traceable\n   320|- `.zeroflow` compatible\n   321|- systemd-executable\n   322|- SLM-sized for Novas\n   323|\n   324|This layer has **three components**:\n   325|\n   326|---\n   327|\n   328|## A..zeroflow as the Source of Truth (SOT)\n   329|\n   330|Tasks exist as:\n   331|\n   332|- `.zeroflow` (current execution)\n   333|- `.zeroflow.golden` (validated best paths)\n   334|- `.zeroflow.library` (shared system-level workflows)\n   335|\n   336|The Nova Planner + ReflexorD both read from here.\n   337|\n   338|This becomes your **Task Definition Language**.\n   339|\n   340|---\n   341|\n   342|## B. Redis Streams (Atomic, Fast Task Execution Queues)\n   343|\n   344|Each Nova gets:\n   345|\n   346|- `nova:<name>:tasks:inbox`\n   347|- `nova:<name>:tasks:work`\n   348|- `nova:<name>:tasks:complete`\n   349|\n   350|Plus team queues:\n   351|\n   352|- `team:<division>:pipeline`\n   353|\n   354|Redis Streams:\n   355|\n   356|- fast\n   357|- atomic\n   358|- ordered\n   359|- perfect for SLM load\n   360|\n   361|This is your **Task Dispatch Engine**.\n   362|\n   363|---\n   364|\n   365|## C. NATS JetStream (Task Coordination + Failover)\n   366|\n   367|Handles:\n   368|\n   369|- retries\n   370|- cross-Nova task forwarding\n   371|- reflex-level overrides\n   372|- heartbeat-based task reassignment\n   373|- quorum-based decision tasks\n   374|\n   375|This is your **Task Resilience Layer**.\n   376|\n   377|---\n   378|\n   379|## 3\\. Memory-Driven Task Logic\n   380|\n   381|Tasks integrate directly with memory:\n   382|\n   383|### A. JanusGraph + ScyllaDB\n   384|\n   385|- Persistent lineage tasks\n   386|- Task dependencies as graph edges\n   387|- Reflex-triggered memory writes\n   388|- \"Telepathy\" shared memory maps\n   389|\n   390|### B. Vector DBs (Milvus, Qdrant, Weaviate)\n   391|\n   392|Store:\n   393|\n   394|- task embeddings\n   